{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_NKZcazowna4aROZESZQng","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.539958+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_NKZcazowna4aROZESZQng","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/30WNPNLJ3sJKOHIlIfKwQtYWFZz29TD0MoB1Eyt0ibvfJeeCkMMicpMbykna3R6YibbNSmnOMntw5dOl4RPe4UJtg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名网址：</span></strong></p><p><font><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</span></span></font></p><p><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span><span>8月30日-9月16日</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>一、报考条件及要求</span></strong></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民；</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>3.优秀应届本科毕业生，并预计能够获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>4.学习成绩优异，并具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质、专业能力等；</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/30WNPNLJ3sI1Tj90K5Hgl8uwq5bbeicJ1vAgY9juwqUPtBLOfNHzL9YEGJ5jVjq8BZZiav24LQL7vrqMicOo3FQGQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>二、材料和注意事项</span></strong></p><p><span>1.上传的材料包括：</span></p><p><span>（1）填写完整的《华东师范大学2025年推免生预报名申请表》（系统自动生成）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人有效居民身份证和《教育部学籍在线认证报告》（至学信网下载）；</span></p><p><span>（3）诚信复试承诺书（见报名系统）；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科成绩单，成绩单需加盖学校教务处或院系公章；</span></p><p><span>（5）个人简历、毕业论文摘要目录等、科研成果、获奖证明、参加项目证明等展现自己综合素质的材料（请考生依据个人实际情况上传）；</span></p><p><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>6</span></span></font><font><span><span>）</span></span></font><font><span><span>直博生申请人还需提交两封专家推荐信（推荐专家需具有副教授及以上专业职称）、拟攻读博士学位的研究计划书（格式不做统一要求）。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>请注意：须保证提交材料真实、准确；无弄虚作假、学术不端。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.请考生务必随时关注预报名系统中的审核状态和学院复试通知，以免错失机会。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><font><span><span>3</span></span></font><span><span>.</span></span><font><span><span>学校着力优化健全资助育人长效，全日制非定向就业博士生、硕士生可享受国家助学金、学业奖学金，并可申请国家奖学金、优秀学业奖学金（</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年新增）及社会奖助学金。详见学校学生资助管理中心相关信息</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><br/></span></font><span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/30WNPNLJ3sI1Tj90K5Hgl8uwq5bbeicJ19rJmFy0LaPEQucGkeXoFKxj9Z77hWJPWhGscC2MoFHwLicvBB06icpbQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>三、特别提醒</span></strong></p><p><font><span><span>      除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读学校</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年博士、硕士研究生者均须在正式取得推免生资格，且在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：</span></span></font><font><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></font><font><span><span>，以下简称“教育部系统”）开通后，另履行正式的填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等程序。</span></span></font><span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/30WNPNLJ3sI1Tj90K5Hgl8uwq5bbeicJ1eQYPMS9iaChOb3hL3iaialpdsPukYSjqXUibmNLOLqx9zggpFFw1QqJibsQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/30WNPNLJ3sLhGU918XVnv0WibQiabicpFR4KYbVPnT990IiaK1nIodfxb5kdm7z8iasRXrTrKAJClDr5uMnEBCDE6Lw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>附：</span><span><span>华东师范大学</span></span><font><span><span>2026</span></span></font><font><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读研究生（含直接攻博）预报名通知：</span></span></font></span></p><p><font></font></p><p><font><span><span>https://yjszs.ecnu.edu.cn/e2/79/c43264a713337/page.htm</span></span></font></p><section><font><span><br/></span></font></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>招生联系方式：</span></strong></p><p><span>学术型硕士联络人—王老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-34756050</span></p><p><span>邮箱：xxwang@soci.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>社会工作（全日制）专硕联络人—郭老师</span></p><p><span>电话：021-54345171</span></p><p><span>邮箱：jguo@soci.ecnu.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4d29bf2ab5ce748175ca64a4d727924998e43200845e25e50985b5e1d812b504","textLength":1006,"sourceSha256":"70f73443ce34061516efcd65be644615f5efad5efeaa50316e2d29a322c1d3f7","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b9c918a57d6441cc8927","title":"2025年华东师范大学社会发展学院2026年推免生（含直博生）预报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:07.539958+00:00"}
